Ṭhākur"},"title":["Akrodha paramānanda"],"author":["by Śrīla Lochan Dās Ṭhākur"],"verses":[{"number":"1","text":["akrodha paramānanda nityānanda rāya","abhimāna-śūnya nitāi nagare beḍāya"],"translation":["The anger-less, prideless, supremely joyful Nityānanda Rāy wanders throughout the towns."],"isLong":false},{"number":"2","text":["adhama patita jīver dvāre dvāre giyā","hari-nāma mahāmantra dena bilāiyā"],"translation":["Going from door to door to the homes of the lowly and fallen souls, He distributes the Hare Kṛṣṇa mahāmantra."],"isLong":false},{"number":"3","text":["yāre dekhe tāre kahe dante tṛṇa dhari’","āmāre kiniyā laha bhaja gaurahari"],"translation":["With straw between His teeth, He says to whoever He sees, “Purchase Me: simply serve Gaurahari.”"],"isLong":false},{"number":"4","text":["eta bali’ nityānanda bhūme gaḍi yāya","sonāra parvata yena dhūlāte loṭāya"],"translation":["Saying this, Nityānanda rolls on the ground like a golden mountain rolling in the dust."],"isLong":false},{"number":"5","text":["hena avatāre yāra rati nā janmila","lochan bale sei pāpī ela āra gela"],"translation":["Lochan Dās says of one who has not developed attachment to this Avatār, “Such a sinner simply came and went.”"],"isLong":false},{"text":["(yāoyā āsā sār ha-ila)","(nitāi-charaṇ nā bhajila    yāoyā āsā sār ha-ila)"],"translation":["“They simply came and went. Those who did not serve Nitāi’s feet simply came and went (took birth and died uselessly).”"],"isLong":false}],"resources":{"audio":[{"title":"Srila B.S. Govinda Dev-Goswami Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/kostya-netrebenko/20-akrodha-paramananda-nityananda-ray-6","personSlug":"srila-b-s-govinda-dev-goswami-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.K. Ashram Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/scsmathcolombia/11-akrodha-paramananda","personSlug":"srila-b-k-ashram-maharaj"},{"title":"Srila B.N. Acharya Maharaj","embed_url":"https://soundcloud.com/bharatimaharaj/acharya-maharaj-akrodha","personSlug":"srila-b-n-